export anchor YogaDuskStyle:
    number: 388
    screen: FitnessTracker
    name: Yoga dusk
    idea: A calm single column under a dusk sky, where the three rings become one slowly breathing circle, every figure is told in a soft sentence, and weeks and plans are strung as beads.
    base: dark
    palette:
        skyHigh: #16132e, the top of the dusk gradient
        skyMid: #2b1f47, the middle of the gradient and the page fallback
        skyLow: #45284f, the warm horizon lower down
        glass: #1a1530, cards at 72 percent over the sky and empty beads
        track: #3a2f55, unfilled ring tracks
        line: #5b4a72, hairlines, the bead string and field borders
        ink: #fbf1ee, text and figures
        muted: #d9c7d6, labels and gentle meta
        peach: #ffb7a1, the move ring, today, highlights in prose, the current bead and the primary button
        sage: #b5dfc0, the exercise ring and zone 2
        lilac: #cbbcff, the stand ring, zone 1 and done beads
        onPeach: #2a1420, text on peach and on zone pebbles
    type:
        Headings and figures use Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype,
        Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia at 400, the greeting 40px, the ring
        centre 44px, card titles 26px, prose 19px at 1.6. Text uses Optima,
        Candara, Segoe UI, Gill Sans, system-ui at 16px and 1.65. The date
        and nav are lowercase, the date 13px tracked 0.12em.
    layout:
        A 760px centred column on a vertical gradient from deep indigo
        through plum to a warm horizon. A small header has brightwork move
        in italic serif and lowercase today, week and plan pills. The date
        and the greeting A gentle close to the day sit centred. Then a 380px
        breathing circle with three concentric ring arcs on soft tracks,
        peach outside, sage, lilac inside, a faint halo that slowly grows
        and settles, and 81% of your move goal with breathe with the halo in
        the centre. A three part legend gives a circle, diamond or rounded
        square, the ring name, value over goal and the amount more. Below,
        rounded glass cards. An evening run card tells the run in one serif
        sentence with peach figures, four soft figure tiles, a row of pill
        pebbles sized by zone minutes with zone numbers, and a lowercase
        zone list. A This week card shows seven glowing moons sized by
        distance with the figure and day, rest days as small dashed hollow
        moons with rest, and today named today. Then Sleep and Half marathon
        side by side, sleep as 7 h 12 min with a sentence on deep sleep, the
        plan as week 6 of 12 with twelve beads on a string, five lilac, the
        sixth larger and peach, and a line about tomorrow's long run of 14
        km. Below 680px the pair stacks and figure tiles go two by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit, generous. 28px between cards, 28 to 32px card padding, a 760px column.
    density: Low. One thing at a time down a single column.
    corners: 28px cards, pills for buttons, fields, nav and zone pebbles, round beads and moons.
    borders: Almost none. A faint lilac edge on cards and hairlines in the style sheet.
    shadows: Soft 50px dusk shadows under cards and warm glows around moons and the current bead.
    icons:
        Ring legend shapes, a circle for move, a diamond for exercise and a
        rounded square for stand. Rest days are dashed hollow moons with the
        word rest. A slow halo paces breathing and stops when reduced motion
        is asked for.
    focus: A 2px light outline offset 4px with a wide soft peach glow.
    tone: Lowercase and gentle, such as A gentle close to the day, breathe with the halo and a long run of 14 km.
